---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section
  id="cta"
  align="center"
  size="lg"
  eyebrow="Get a demo"
  title="Turn weeks of paperwork into hours"
  subtitle="If you’re producing warrants/planning packs regularly, this pays for itself fast."
>
  <div class="mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
      <a
        href="#"
        class="rounded-xl bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-black hover:opacity-90"
      >
        Book a demo
      </a>
      <a
        href="#features"
        class="rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-white/5 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10"
      >
        See features
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-white/50">No hard sell. Just a walkthrough and your use-case.</p>
  </div>
</Section>